  "generationId": "01a1e8eb-79e7-7f5b-a0a2-1cc13f5ae927",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1971-196/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.67288
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Mulla Nasrudin was searching for something on the ground What have you lost, Mulla? someone who saw him searching, asked.",
      "path": "audio/1971-196/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.984921,
      "end": 9.098911999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "My key, said the Mulla.",
      "path": "audio/1971-196/03.mp3",
      "start": 10.362562,
      "end": 11.977029
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "So they both went down on their knees and looked for it.",
      "path": "audio/1971-196/04.mp3",
      "start": 13.262744000000001,
      "end": 15.866463
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "After a time the other man asked: Where exactly did you drop it?",
      "path": "audio/1971-196/05.mp3",
      "start": 17.098594,
      "end": 21.130249000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "In my house, said the Mulla.",
      "path": "audio/1971-196/06.mp3",
      "start": 22.708209,
      "end": 25.22449
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Then why are you looking here?",
      "path": "audio/1971-196/07.mp3",
      "start": 27.047981999999998,
      "end": 28.558798
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "There is more light here than inside my house.",
      "path": "audio/1971-196/08.mp3",
      "start": 30.122676,
      "end": 32.705669
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "I ask you also - where are you looking for the key?",
      "path": "audio/1971-196/09.mp3",
      "start": 34.265147000000006,
      "end": 38.120272
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Inside the house?",
      "path": "audio/1971-196/10.mp3",
      "start": 39.624376000000005,
      "end": 41.2
    }
  ]
}
